# ERA - Erase selected files

```text
ERA filespec
:ERA /C filespec
```

## Select files

Inspect the same filespec with [DIR](DIR.HLP) before erasing it. A
wildcard can select several files. A drive/user prefix confines the
operation to that location.

```text
DIR D3:*.BAK
ERA D3:OLD.BAK
```

## Confirm each file

Use the transient command to review a group one file at a time. Answer
each prompt to erase or keep that file.

```text
:ERA /C D3:*.BAK
```
